    fap_description="One control surface for a 3-in-1 ESP32 + NRF24 + CC1101 expansion board. Drives the ESP32 Marauder serial CLI (dual-band Wi-Fi, BLE, GPS, 2.4G) with a live console; runs a 2.4 GHz spectrum analyzer on the NRF24 across all 126 channels; and sweeps the 300-348 / 387-464 / 779-928 MHz Sub-GHz bands on the CC1101 (internal or external). For authorised testing and RF exploration on hardware and networks you own.",
